{"id": 45, "name": "Argus", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/a/ac/Hero451-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20250407160733", "cls": ["Fighter", ""], "specialty": ["Charge", "Burst"], "difficulty": "60", "stats": ["70", "50", "50", "60"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", ""], "story": "The angel who fell from light into darkness.", "skills": [{"name": "Warmonger", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f8a28cd195d4ec474f361daee0d0de6c.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "When Argus' Meteoric Sword reaches 100 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Malice Energy</span>, he will launch a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Demonic Slash</span> with his next Basic Attack, dealing 180<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and recovering 150<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+10% Total Physical Attack)</span> HP. This attack ignores 40% of the target's Physical Defense.\nArgus' Meteoric Sword gains 5 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Malice Energy</span> per second and 10 Energy per Basic Attack (critical strikes grant an additional 10 Energy)."}, {"name": "Demonic Grip", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b90caeb8b5854f2585f4c9af760e026a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12", "desc": "Argus stretches out a demonic hand in the target direction, dealing 125<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+60% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to the first enemy hero or Creep hit, stunning them for 0.7s, and pulling him and the target towards each other. If no enemy is hit, Argus pulls himself toward the hand's destination instead.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again</span>: Argus dashes and strikes in the target direction, dealing 175<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies along the path."}, {"name": "Meteoric Sword", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_79110528884ec6365c2e9395dc1bc11b.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 23, "tagname": "Debuff", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10", "desc": "After a short delay, Argus thrusts his Meteoric Sword in the target direction, dealing 120<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies hit (200% damage against minions) and reducing their Movement Speed by 80% for 0.8s. The delay time decreases as Argus's Attack Speed increases. Enemy heroes hit will be <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Cursed</span> for 4s, during which they leave a Cursed Trail behind. Argus gains 20% Movement Speed while on a Cursed Trail.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Meteoric Sword</span> damage counts as Basic Attack damage and can trigger Attack Effects. Hitting heroes restores 100 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Malice Energy</span> (excess is preserved)."}, {"name": "Eternal Evil", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_41fe2a5e02169da266ce942372ad1e91.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 43, "tagname": "Death Immunity", "tagrgb": "177,157,96"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 60", "desc": "Argus removes all debuffs on himself, dealing 150<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fba51f\">Physical Damage</span> to nearby enemies and becoming the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fallen Angel</span> for 4s (hitting heroes enhances <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Warmonger</span>). <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fallen Angel</span>: Gains 40% Movement Speed that decays over 1s; when the transformation ends, he converts all his damage dealt in the Fallen Angel state into HP. If he takes fatal damage in the Fallen Angel state, the duration of the Movement Speed boost will be reset, and he will gain <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Death Immunity</span> for 4s. <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Enhanced Warmonger</span>: <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Demonic Slash</span> grants 50 Malice Energy (50 extra Malice Energy with critical hits).\nIf <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Death Immunity</span> isn't triggered, the cooldown will be reduced by 50%."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Corrosion Scythe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_486be2a89fc7fba69cd82c71d80395af.png"}, {"name": "Windtalker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_9c06b97bb75d8a81e28a87df1ab92193.png"}, {"name": "Berserker's Fury", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_020f531307fa505083b791e6f3093eb4.png"}, {"name": "Haas' Claws", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_139190ae1087ea51233fdbefb1bbbf5b.png"}, {"name": "Great Dragon Spear", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f6453844f4f326287d4ec7920d2f1044.png"}, {"name": "Blade of Despair", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f9fa31f80ff0aa02216bc85efe81ea1f.png"}], "emblem": {"name": "Marksman", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_99f3b68d12e90a6cf8f465ff3a71c850.png"}, "talents": [{"name": "Fatal", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6f644fb053f5dbc8e5712166e6d46314.png", "tier": 1}, {"name": "Weapons Master", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_893891a86726cbf0b00401127a1f9486.png", "tier": 2}, {"name": "Concussive Blast", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8aecfaa8ede10da59